> You can now read where value lives. [[Part 3.1 - Power|Part 3.1 — Power]] asks the next question: even when a business makes and keeps value, what stops competitors from copying it and competing the profit away? The answer is what strategists call "power," and it's the thing that decides whether value stays with the business *over time*. Without power, every well-run business eventually gets eaten.

